    {"type":"text","id":"summary_t","x":380,"y":1555,"width":1590,"height":110,"text":"4 chiều traffic cần nhớ\n1 Laptop→Bastion: IGW → facing NACL IN(dst22) → bastion-SG IN(dst22) → Bastion\n2 Bastion→Laptop: bastion-SG OUT(auto) → facing NACL OUT(dst client ephemeral) → public RT 0.0.0.0/0 → IGW\n3 Bastion→Private: bastion-SG OUT(dst22) → facing NACL OUT(dst22) → public RT local → VPC router → service NACL IN(dst22) → service-SG IN(dst22)\n4 Private→Bastion: service-SG OUT(auto) → service NACL OUT(dst bastion ephemeral) → service RT local → VPC router → facing NACL IN(dst bastion ephemeral) → bastion-SG IN(auto)","originalText":"4 chiều traffic cần nhớ\n1 Laptop→Bastion: IGW → facing NACL IN(dst22) → bastion-SG IN(dst22) → Bastion\n2 Bastion→Laptop: bastion-SG OUT(auto) → facing NACL OUT(dst client ephemeral) → public RT 0.0.0.0/0 → IGW\n3 Bastion→Private: bastion-SG OUT(dst22) → facing NACL OUT(dst22) → public RT local → VPC router → service NACL IN(dst22) → service-SG IN(dst22)\n4 Private→Bastion: service-SG OUT(auto) → service NACL OUT(dst bastion ephemeral) → service RT local → VPC router → facing NACL IN(dst bastion ephemeral) → bastion-SG IN(auto)","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#22c55e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":307003,"version":1,"versionNonce":307004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
